      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create extract_text.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts plain text from a scanned document image.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2935b5001Sy8cXU5438GShw",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc2935b0001Smy2F0BFJXM8ir",
